        "axes": "+Y barrel (along the hand, ahead in the hold), +Z weapon top (up in the IdleArmed / WalkArmed hold: thumb side of the inward-turned grip)"
      },
      "runtime_contract": {
        "clip_names": "looping clips carry a \"-loop\" suffix (Godot imports them as Idle / IdleArmed / Walk / WalkArmed with loop LINEAR); look clips up by both names",
        "armed": "IdleArmed / WalkArmed (low forward waist hold, MUTON.PCK rarm2H 248 - routine 10 draws one-handed weapons with it) when the unit holds a weapon; Attack starts and ends in that hold and raises it to a shoulder-height aim; attach the weapon to the weapon_r bone (+Y barrel, +Z top)",
        "kneel": null,
        "no_kneel": "routine 10 draws no kneel legs (MUTON.PCK 24-31 are empty): no Kneel clip",
        "turn_to_attacker": null,
        "hit": "non-lethal: play Hit<variant> (0.3 s directional recoil; variant from the shot direction relative to the facing, ragdoll.handoff.variant_rule); no turn",
        "death": "user decisions 2026-10-02: play Death<variant> (0.133 s snappy recoil away from the shot; no turn, no crumple); on its last frame start the ragdoll with that variant's velocities (ragdoll.handoff.variants), the ground-clearance lift, the same push delta-v on EVERY body along the shot (ragdoll.handoff.extra_push.bones), the whole-body twist toward the shooter (ragdoll.handoff.twist_toward_shooter: rigid rotation of all bodies about the vertical, 0 for a frontal shot, full from behind) and the per-death variation; settle-and-freeze with the settle-assist, the late assist and the depenetration lift (ragdoll.settle_and_freeze); DeathBaked is the no-physics fallback (DeathFront, then falls backward)",
        "blood": "every shot: ray-cast against the visible skinned mesh, a wound decal at the hit point on the hit bone (BoneAttachment3D, cull mask = the unit's own visual layer, capped) with drip runs growing down the surface; the decal carries a dark ragged entry hole (3 variants per wound, random roll per hit, wound_decals.variants); the hit spray starts AT the skin on that hole (emitter spray.runtime.origin_inset_m inside the surface, burst-origin texel on it, billboard pulled depth_pull_m toward the camera) and flies BACK toward the shooter (normalize(-shot + normal), blood.json spray.runtime); at death floor splatter decals; pool under the frozen corpse inside the death tile. No UV0 wound overlay"
      },
      "albedo_policy": "MUTON.PCK battlescape colour families (suit green ramp #104404..#588c20, face violet #8c4ca8), no per-asset darkening or brightening (user 2026-10-02: modern lighting renders units brighter, accepted)",
      "source_assumptions": [
        "Proportions from UP020 (UFOpaedia Muton) and the battlescape PCK: a hulking body, deltoid breadth ~0.6 of the height, a small round hooded head sunk between the trapezius masses, long thick arms (fists by the hips), narrow waist, thick legs in a wide stance, big flat feet.",
        "The green is read as a muscle-relief bio-suit covering everything but a violet face oval (UP020 / PCK); the relief exaggerates the body's own muscle forms (band-pass gain).",
        "Face: human-like violet face, heavy brow, narrow dark eyes (UP020); unseen back of the hood inferred (round dome).",
        "Hands: five-digit clenched fists (UP020 / PCK).",
        "Idle / Hit authored (routine 10 has no idle or hit frames); armed hold = rarm2H 248 (routine 10 one-handed); no kneel.",
        "Walk: 8 sprite phases per gait cycle, 1 m stride (2 cycles per straight tile).",
        "Death: snappy directional recoil (user 2026-10-02), ragdoll at 0.133 s with the whole-body twist toward the shooter; DeathBaked keeps a no-physics fall as fallback.",
        "Blood: orange-brown #9c6424 from the MUTON.PCK death frames 264-266; wounds at the real impact point (shared tint-neutral wound / drip textures with Muton entry holes), spray from the skin back toward the shooter.",
        "Suit micro-surface: ambientCG Rubber004 (CC0) displacement baked into the normal map."
      ],
